{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12438","headline":"同王錥起居程浩郎中韩翃舍人题安国寺用上人院 · 钱起","name":"同王錥起居程浩郎中韩翃舍人题安国寺用上人院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慧眼沙门真远公，经行宴坐有儒风。\n香缘不绝簪裾会，禅想宁妨藻思通。\n曙後鑪烟生不灭，晴来堦色并归空。\n狂夫入室无余事，唯与天花一笑同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}